sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Устройство
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant REC as recording-service
    participant DEV as device-service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant TR as transcription-service
    participant YA as Yandex SpeechKit
    participant AN as analysis-service
    participant VEN as venue-service
    participant GC as GigaChat
    participant REP as report-service

    Note over D: VAD выделил фрагмент разговора у кассы (ogg/opus)
    D->>GW: POST /device/v1/recordings (X-Device-Token, Idempotency-Key = chunkId)
    GW->>REC: проксирование
    REC->>DEV: S2 POST /internal/v1/devices/verify
    DEV-->>REC: 200 {deviceId, venueId, ACTIVE}
    REC->>REC: файл → MinIO, запись в БД (status UPLOADED)
    REC-->>D: 201 Recording
    REC-)MQ: recording.uploaded (correlationId = recordingId)
    MQ-)TR: recording.uploaded
    TR->>REC: S3 GET /internal/v1/recordings/{id}/audio-url
    REC-->>TR: 200 presigned URL (15 мин)
    TR->>YA: распознавание + диаризация
    YA-->>TR: сегменты текста по дикторам
    TR->>TR: сохранить Transcript (MongoDB)
    TR-)MQ: transcription.completed
    MQ-)REC: transcription.completed → status TRANSCRIBED
    MQ-)AN: transcription.completed
    AN->>TR: S4 GET /internal/v1/transcripts/{id}
    TR-->>AN: 200 Transcript
    AN->>VEN: S5 GET /internal/v1/venues/{id}/menu
    VEN-->>AN: 200 меню с наличием и синонимами
    AN->>GC: промпт: отбросить личное и «воду», выделить инциденты
    GC-->>AN: JSON: OUT_OF_STOCK «лавандовый раф»
    AN->>AN: сохранить инциденты
    AN-)MQ: analysis.completed
    MQ-)REP: analysis.completed
    REP->>VEN: S6 GET /internal/v1/venues/{id} (имя, часовой пояс, кэш)
    VEN-->>REP: 200 Venue
    REP->>REP: upsert DailyReport(venueId, date), +1 OUT_OF_STOCK
    MQ-)REC: analysis.completed → status ANALYZED, удалить аудио из MinIO
